            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That's an interesting idea, thanks!\r\n\r\nI'll think about this, but in its own way the MiniMax generated config *is itself* meant to be this kind of \"TutorMini\". Every part is documented and written in a way that should be both concise yet informative (and least that was an intention).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">That's an interesting idea, thanks!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'll think about this, but in its own way the MiniMax generated config <em>is itself</em> meant to be this kind of \"TutorMini\". Every part is documented and written in a way that should be both concise yet informative (and least that was an intention).</p>",
